<title>GERMANY: BOXING-GERMANY'S ROCCHIGIANI RETAINS WBO TITLE.</title>
<headline>BOXING-GERMANY'S ROCCHIGIANI RETAINS WBO TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>HANOVER, Germany 1996-12-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's Ralf Rocchigiani retained his World Boxing Organisation cruiserweight title on Saturday when he beat Stefan Angehrn of Switzerland with a unanimous points decision.</p>
</text>
